      ":question/problem": "Find $j$, if $4{a}_{1}+j{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
